+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in [README](../README.md).
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with header
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Quantities are positive whole numbers and soldAt
+is an ISO instant. Previously imported tickets are skipped. The response is
+`{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`, counting new tickets and portions.
+The import is atomic and row errors identify the CSV line.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+`{ "itemId": 1, "theoretical": 1, "actual": 2, "difference": 1 }`.
+Days are inclusive UTC days; difference is actual minus theoretical.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
